[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0117","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0117.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6685","title":"ChaN FatFs 整数下溢越界写入漏洞","description":"CVE-2026-6685 最初被分配用于描述 FatFs 文件系统（ChaN FatFs）中存在的整数下溢漏洞。该漏洞涉及在 f_read() 函数中因无符号减法下溢导致的脏缓存越界写入问题，理论上可导致系统崩溃或数据损坏。然而，经 CVE 编号管理机构（CNA）复核确认，该漏洞判定存在错误，因此本 CVE 编号已被正式拒绝/撤销，不应视为有效安全漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6685"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12Z","updated":"2026-07-16T21:17:22Z","remediation":"该 CVE 已被 CNA 确认为误报并撤销，实际不存在安全漏洞，无需安装任何补丁或采取缓解措施。如果代码中已根据该报告添加了相关修复，建议移除临时补丁以避免不必要的性能开销。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6685.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6685.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/src/ff.c","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6685.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6685.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E4%B8%8B%E6%BA%A2%E8%84%8F%E7%BC%93%E5%AD%98%E8%B6%8A%E7%95%8C%E5%86%99%E5%85%A5_CVE-2026-6685.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6685.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-rggj-rv54-4gvx/GHSA-rggj-rv54-4gvx.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-6685.json","https://github.com/vulnlog/vulnlog/blob/4faafaeb092f8d2e222dfe40d2065cc31efd2aba/docs/modules/ROOT/pages/get-started/quickstart-report.adoc","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6685"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0117.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0116","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0116.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6684","title":"ChaN FatFs GPT 分区扫描无限循环拒绝服务漏洞","description":"FatFs（ChaN FatFs）在启用 FF_LBA64=1 并使用 GPT 分区扫描功能时存在无限循环漏洞（CWE-835）。攻击者通过向目标设备提供包含特制 GPT 分区表的镜像文件，触发 find_volume() 函数中由 GPTH_PtNum 字段控制的无界循环，导致系统在挂载扫描时陷入长时间阻塞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 FatFs R0.16 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。攻击者需物理接触目标设备写入特制镜像，攻击条件较为受限，但在嵌入式/IoT 设备场景中仍具有实际威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6684"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12Z","updated":"2026-07-02T14:38:25Z","remediation":"建议将 FatFs 升级至 R0.16 或更高版本，该版本已通过 test_gpt_header() 对 GPT 分区条目数上限和 CRC 完整性进行校验，防止恶意分区表触发无限循环。如无法立即升级，可在 ffconf.h 中将 FF_LBA64 设置为 0 以禁用 GPT 分区扫描，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-gpt-scan-loop-dos-cve-2026-6684/","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6684.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6684.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/sbom.yml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6684.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6684.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_GPT_%E5%88%86%E5%8C%BA%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E6%97%A0%E9%99%90%E5%BE%AA%E7%8E%AF_CVE-2026-6684.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6684.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-vhc7-qgwj-vx6v/GHSA-vhc7-qgwj-vx6v.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance/blob/9fe74a1773a10f7061b60151ace5ac1039021480/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-6684.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6684"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0116.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0115","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6683","title":"ChaN FatFs exFAT 除零错误漏洞","description":"FatFs（ChaN FatFs）R0.16 及更早版本的 exFAT 文件系统同步逻辑中存在除零错误漏洞。当攻击者构建特制的 exFAT 镜像，使 BPB_NumClusEx 字段值为 0 时，在调用 sync_fs() 写同步操作过程中会触发除零异常，导致程序崩溃或拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞需物理接触设备或通过网络分发恶意更新介质触发，影响使用 FatFs 的嵌入式系统、IoT 设备及固件环境，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6683"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12Z","updated":"2026-07-02T14:38:07Z","remediation":"立即升级至 FatFs R0.16 或更高版本。R0.16 已包含部分挂载时的除数检查保护，可降低触发风险。对于无法升级的嵌入式系统，可在 sync_fs() 函数入口处增加 n_fatent <= 2 的提前返回检查，避免除零操作。同时，在挂载外部 exFAT 卷前校验 BPB_NumClusEx 字段，若为零则拒绝挂载该卷。上游 runZero 已在 GitHub 发布补丁示例（https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance），建议参考集成。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-exfat-divide-by-zero-cve-2026-6683","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6683.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6683.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/src/ff.c","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2bdccdc718eb7ee3dca97ad4cd1a43e8a13111b5/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6683.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6683.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_exFAT_%E9%99%A4%E9%9B%B6%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF_CVE-2026-6683.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6683.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-74cg-p8q3-4c3q/GHSA-74cg-p8q3-4c3q.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance/blob/9fe74a1773a10f7061b60151ace5ac1039021480/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/834e72bf1d790a78930554cd283f772f3690fc67/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-6683.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6683"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0114","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0114.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-6682","title":"ChaN FatFs FAT32 整数溢出漏洞","description":"FatFs（ChaN FatFs）R0.16 及之前版本的 FAT32 文件系统挂载函数 mount_volume() 中存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190）。当攻击者构造一个 BPB_FATSz32 字段值为 0x80000001 的恶意 FAT32 镜像时，fasize 与 fs->n_fats 的乘法运算会发生整数回绕，导致后续读取操作的偏移量和长度被攻击者控制。该漏洞允许物理接触的攻击者通过挂载特制 FAT32 镜像实现任意内存读取或代码执行，在 OTA/固件更新场景下也可远程触发。CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-6682"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-07-01T15:17:12Z","updated":"2026-07-02T14:37:48Z","remediation":"立即从 https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/ 下载并应用 FatFs R0.16 的 2026 年 7 月 10 日最新补丁，或在 mount_volume() 中 fasize *= fs->n_fats 运算前添加整数溢出检查：if (fs->n_fats > 0 && fasize > UINT_MAX / fs->n_fats) return FR_INT_ERR；同时校验 BPB_FATSz32 字段值不超过合法范围作为深层防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://elm-chan.org/fsw/ff/","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance","https://www.runzero.com/advisories/fatfs-fat32-int-of-mnt-cve-2026-6682/","https://www.runzero.com/blog/fatfs-bugs/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-6682.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6682.json","https://github.com/espressif/esp-idf/blob/055ba9d3f9c6fd9a0efacd4993a2a942972dd65d/components/fatfs/src/ff.c","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-07-01/TIER_2_CVE-2026-6682.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/6xxx/CVE-2026-6682.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-6682.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/FatFs_FAT32_%E6%95%B4%E6%95%B0%E6%BA%A2%E5%87%BA_CVE-2026-6682.toml","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/df044812b70860d79ecaa4ed9deebd528d9595d4/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-6682.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e52c2c075f8ae41771cb3f6120956c7f745eea35/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-c25x-vcg6-4ccx/GHSA-c25x-vcg6-4ccx.json","https://github.com/runZeroInc/vulns-2026-fatfs-chance/blob/9fe74a1773a10f7061b60151ace5ac1039021480/harness/rce_demo.c","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-6682"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0114.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0503","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0503.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-2046","title":"GIMP LBM文件解析堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"GIMP 在处理 LBM 格式文件时存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于程序未对文件中的特定字段进行充分的大小校验，攻击者可构造特制的 LBM 文件诱导用户打开，触发堆缓冲区溢出，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 GIMP 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。用户交互是触发该漏洞的必要条件，攻击者需通过社会工程学手段诱骗目标打开恶意文件。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-2046"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-07-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 GIMP 至 3.2.0 及以上版本（推荐最新 3.2.4），该漏洞已在提交 b4d41182 中修复。Debian 用户升级至 3.2.4-3，Ubuntu 用户等待官方更新。临时缓解措施：不要打开来源不明的 .lbm/.ilbm 文件，在文件关联中取消 GIMP 默认打开此类格式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b7d9f3f65d1036a114c9bae4a66ed35d83999166/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-2046.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-2046","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/89baa37416f747c921bc1b8bfb7fbb739847eafb/tracker/CVE/2026/CVE-2026-2046.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20462.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/13cb9776e1a75871fdb2907e6c4ccac1909e538b/2026/20xxx/CVE-2026-20461.json","https://github.com/RogoLabs/GhostCVEs/blob/f4fa13677cfb779d11c65819551d752402c8b4a2/reports/ghost_report.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-20463.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/3919917ccdc95cad53a5d8f952d8d044dc152929/content/posts/cve-2026-20463.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-20460.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2026/07/GHSA-7cqg-gq5x-qr9q/GHSA-7cqg-gq5x-qr9q.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0503.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0239","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0239.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13149","title":"brace-expansion 大括号扩展拒绝服务漏洞","description":"brace-expansion 是 Node.js 生态中广泛使用的字符串展开库，其 expand() 函数在处理连续非扩展 {} 组时存在指数级时间复杂度缺陷（O(2ⁿ)）。攻击者仅需构造约 90 字节（30 个分组）的短 ASCII 字符串即可触发该缺陷，导致 Node.js 单线程事件循环被长时间阻塞，轻则分钟级挂起，重则进程彻底卡死。由于 brace-expansion 被大量上层包间接依赖（如 glob、npm 等），攻击面广。该漏洞影响至 5.0.6 版本，CVSS 评分 7.7，危害等级高。max 选项仅限制输出数量而非递归计算量，无法缓解此问题。目前无官方补丁，建议停止使用或限制输入字符串长度。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13149","GHSA-3jxr-9vmj-r5cp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-30T10:16:34Z","updated":"2026-07-08T12:17:20Z","remediation":"立即将 brace-expansion 升级至 5.0.7 或以上版本（npm install brace-expansion@latest），该版本已修复 expand() 函数对连续非扩展 {} 组的指数级时间复杂度问题。注意 max 选项仅限制输出数组大小而非递归深度，无法作为有效缓解措施，必须通过版本升级修复。如无法升级，可在调用 expand() 前对输入字符串中连续非扩展 {} 组的数量进行限制（建议不超过 10 组），或改用其他不依赖递归展开的 brace expansion 实现。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/juliangruber/brace-expansion/commit/c7e33ec13ac1a684c116720843ce24e208611754","https://www.npmjs.com/package/brace-expansion","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13149.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-13149.json","https://github.com/crowi/crowi/blob/b160978375b5c2f90db7de6a642c0e6134c13406/.changeset/brace-expansion-redos-fix.md","https://github.com/snyk/broker/blob/863ecf8f94711ff992fef80b113f55de8b5e7c5f/.snyk","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/brace-expansion/CVE-2026-13149.yml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-13149.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-13149","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13149.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-13149.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-13149.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0239.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0470","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0470.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-12578","title":"DTMSoft 项目文件反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"DTMSoft 产品在解析项目文件时存在反序列化不可信数据漏洞（CWE-502）。攻击者可通过构造特制的恶意项目文件，诱使用户在受影响产品中打开该文件，触发反序列化过程，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 DTMSoft 相关产品，攻击复杂度低且无需任何权限，但需要用户交互（如打开恶意文件）。成功利用可导致机密性、完整性和可用性完全丧失，CVSS 评分 8.4，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-12578"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-06-30T09:16:24Z","updated":"2026-06-30T14:18:42Z","remediation":"建议立即联系台达技术支持获取 DTMSoft 修复版本，或参考 Delta-PCSA-2026-00010 安全公告安装补丁。如无法立即升级，采取以下临时缓解措施：不要打开来源不明的项目文件或邮件附件，避免以管理员权限运行 DTMSoft，使用标准用户权限运行以限制攻击影响范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://filecenter.deltaww.com/news/download/doc/Delta-PCSA-2026-00010_DTMSoft%20Project%20File%20Parsing%20Deserialization%20of%20Untrusted%20Data%20Remote%20Code%20(CVE-2026-12578)_v1.0.pdf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2026/12xxx/CVE-2026-12578.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/e6fb55bfbbe31c8b8776d60f6e3b3154ee0fa3bf/reports/2026-06-30/TIER_3_CVE-2026-12578.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2026/12xxx/CVE-2026-12578.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/081b07b9127f2841c08bad5c94aba4d1bf47bb88/content/posts/cve-2026-12578.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-12578.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-qrm2-gj4m-7475/GHSA-qrm2-gj4m-7475.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-12578.json","https://github.com/icsadvprj/ICS-Advisory-Project/blob/5538b1613093673931222be0ab4f9449da32d3d0/ICS-CERT_ADV/CISA_ICS_ADV_2026_7_23_26.csv","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/32f2293479ff686679659fbb5e0a89dfb65ba641/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-07-03_11-37-40.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-12578.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0470.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0626","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0626.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55607","title":"Anthropic Claude Code 工作树路径混淆沙箱逃逸漏洞","description":"Claude Code 的工作树处理机制存在路径混淆漏洞，允许攻击者创建名为 \".git\" 的工作树并导航到沙箱上下文之外的工作树，从而发起 Git 目录混淆攻击。通过利用符号链接操纵和工作树操作期间的 git fsmonitor 执行，攻击者可以覆盖用户主目录中的文件（如 .zshenv），导致在 macOS Seatbelt 沙箱限制之外执行任意代码。成功利用此漏洞需要用户克隆包含提示注入内容的恶意仓库并针对该仓库运行 Claude Code。该漏洞影响 Claude Code 2.1.38 至 2.1.163 版本，CVSS 评分 7.7，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55607","GHSA-7835-87q9-rgvv"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-29T15:16:41Z","updated":"2026-06-30T16:17:39Z","remediation":"立即将 Claude Code 升级至 2.1.163 或更高版本。使用 Claude Code 自动更新功能的用户已自动修复；手动更新的用户请运行 `npm update @anthropic-ai/claude-code -g` 或重新安装最新版本。在升级完成前，避免在不可信仓库上运行 Claude Code，并检查 .zshenv 等关键配置文件是否被篡改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/security/advisories/GHSA-7835-87q9-rgvv","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/487ea3f21ed49470634e758e1f8f2ac74b64d6b0/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55607.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55607.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-55607.json","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/c47d1f5d848e164abef61b16f1d28d5df1852f8c/proposals/nvd/CVE-2026-55607.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6052148b71cb79d42fd4a59f87982387b0487834/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-55607.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-06-29/TIER_2_CVE-2026-55607.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-55607.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-55607.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4aa573a753d6387eff023ebcf6fc6297b912048e/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-556xx/CVE-2026-55607.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/npm/@anthropic-ai/claude-code/CVE-2026-55607.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0626.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0241","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0241.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-13676","title":"fast-uri IDN主机名规范化工不当漏洞","description":"fast-uri 是一个 Node.js URL 解析库，其 2.3.1 至 4.0.0 版本在处理 Unicode/IDN 主机名时存在规范化工缺陷。该库调用不存在的全局 URL 辅助函数进行 IDN 转换，导致 TypeError 被静默吞入 parsed.error，而 parse()、normalize()、equal() 等函数仍返回未规范化的 Unicode 形式主机名。攻击者可通过构造含全角字符的 URL（如 http://127。0。0。1/）绕过基于主机名的安全策略（黑名单、环回过滤、重定向验证、出站代理路由），因为 fast-uri 与 Node 原生 URL 解析器对同一输入解析出不同主机。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响使用 fast-uri 进行主机策略校验的 Node.js 应用。建议升级至 3.1.3 或 4.0.1 版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-13676","GHSA-4c8g-83qw-93j6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-29T14:16:47Z","updated":"2026-07-21T12:17:19Z","remediation":"升级 fast-uri 至 3.1.3（3.x 分支）或 4.0.1（4.x 分支）。如无法升级，在主机策略检查前拒绝所有非 ASCII 主机名，或使用与后续实际请求相同的 URL 解析器执行策略校验，避免因解析差异导致绕过。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cna.openjsf.org/security-advisories.html","https://github.com/fastify/fast-uri/security/advisories/GHSA-4c8g-83qw-93j6","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:37186","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:37585","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:37628","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:40118","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:40262","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:40945","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:41066","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:41928","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:41929","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-13676","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2494197","https://security.access.redhat.com/data/csaf/v2/vex/2026/cve-2026-13676.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13676.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-13676.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/ef01d7e98bf039082d22217e9d85a4cfb59bb732/reports/2026-06-29/TIER_2_CVE-2026-13676.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/npm/fast-uri/CVE-2026-13676.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-13676","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b5611c329e651f1fd606ff16e22adf5d86508695/content/posts/cve-2026-13676.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2026-13676.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2026/13xxx/CVE-2026-13676.json","https://github.com/cyberdudebivash/cyberdudebivash-blog/blob/45bc652ff79f8949ca15d5de8959068671b69187/cve/CVE-2026-13676.html","https://github.com/epam/ai-dial-admin-frontend/blob/df71c07f4b4826014f09c70b62d0d3f780cf8637/.trivyignore"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0241.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0241.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0112","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-58053","title":"Gitea act_runner 容器逃逸漏洞","description":"Gitea act_runner 的 Docker 后端（受影响版本至 act 0.262.0）在处理工作流容器配置时存在权限管理缺陷，仅强制关闭容器 Privileged 标志，但未过滤 --pid=host、--cap-add 等危险选项。能够在 Docker 后端 runner 上运行工作流的攻击者可利用此问题创建拥有宿主机命名空间和广泛能力的容器，在特权模式被禁用的情况下仍实现容器逃逸并获得宿主机 root 权限。CVSS 评分 9.4，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.4,"aliases":["CVE-2026-58053"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-28T02:16:32Z","updated":"2026-06-30T15:17:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 act_runner 至 0.263.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了容器选项合并时未强制禁用高危 HostConfig 参数的问题。临时缓解措施：在 act_runner 配置中禁止使用 --pid=host、--cap-add、--security-opt 等高危容器选项；为 runner 添加 seccomp 策略限制容器逃逸相关系统调用；仅运行可信工作流，不向不可信用户开放 act_runner 执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/bikini/exploitarium/tree/main/gitea-act-runner-container-options-poc","https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gitea-act-runner-container-hardening-bypass-via-workflow-container-options","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2026/CVE-2026-58053.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/59955f89028f6eb26686f8a6493373afe445701a/cves/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58053.json","https://github.com/bikini/exploitarium/blob/cdcbe772ed7ee2a36f2d84a93018f820a32a4a9f/cves.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/CVE/blob/4e96ec5c1f919e7ddf89ce2335ced09b058e2b49/2026.06/CVE-2026-58053%EF%BC%9AGitea%20act_runner%20%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E9%80%83%E9%80%B8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-28/TIER_2_CVE-2026-58053.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/58xxx/CVE-2026-58053.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-58053.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/Gitea_act_runner_%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E9%80%83%E9%80%B8_CVE-2026-58053.toml","https://github.com/Vu1nT0tal/yarb/blob/2853b83f9525211a3c7c25f2ab4e006505d500ad/archive/2026/2026-07-03.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/b7272967d4cf0923f79d101c86e7ecac005fe400/doc/2026-07/%E3%80%90%E9%AB%98%E5%8D%B1%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E9%A2%84%E8%AD%A6%E3%80%91Gitea%20act_runner%20%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8%E9%80%83%E9%80%B8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9ECVE-2026-58053.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-58053"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0112.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0112.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0799","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0799.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54753","title":"Nx nx graph 开发服务器跨源信息泄露漏洞","description":"Nx 的 `nx graph` 开发服务器在 HTTP 响应中设置了通配符 CORS 头 `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *`，导致任意恶意网站可跨域读取服务器返回的完整项目依赖图及 `/help` 端点输出。`/help` 端点通过 `execSync` 执行目标配置的命令，在极少数情况下可导致任意命令注入。攻击者需诱使正在运行 `nx graph` 的开发者访问恶意页面，利用条件较高。影响版本为 `17.0.4` 至 `22.7.2` 之前及 `23.0.0-beta.0` 至 `23.0.0-beta.2` 之前，已在 `22.7.2` 和 `23.0.0-beta.2` 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54753","GHSA-g2r8-wvmj-jf5w"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-06-26T19:16:43Z","updated":"2026-06-26T20:20:22Z","remediation":"立即将 nx 升级到 22.7.2 或更高版本（npm install nx@latest），或升级到 23.0.0-beta.2 及以上版本。21.x 用户应直接升级到 22.7.2+。如无法升级，避免在开发时运行 nx graph 命令，或在使用时确保不同时访问不可信网站。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/nrwl/nx/pull/35494","https://github.com/nrwl/nx/security/advisories/GHSA-g2r8-wvmj-jf5w","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54753.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54753.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54753.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54753.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-54753.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54753.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/npm/nx/CVE-2026-54753.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54753.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/65a328502a723ec4191dc80b53c8c169dc6165eb/2026/CVE-2026-54753.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/e9f55b097256f05949a0f1dbecc8a1a5fe970fe7/content/posts/cve-2026-54753.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0799.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0104","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54826","title":"SupportCandy WordPress 插件不安全直接对象引用漏洞","description":"WordPress SupportCandy 客服支持插件 3.4.6 及之前版本存在不安全直接对象引用（IDOR）漏洞，CVE 编号 CVE-2026-54826，CWE-639。已认证的订阅者用户可通过篡改请求中的对象标识符参数，越权访问其他用户创建的工单数据，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者无需特殊权限，仅需订阅者账户即可利用，影响大量使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。CVSS 评分 7.6，危害等级高危。厂商建议升级至 3.4.7 及以上版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54826"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-26T15:16:40Z","updated":"2026-06-29T18:16:37Z","remediation":"立即升级 Jenkins 至 2.516.2 LTS 或 2.518 及以上版本；在防火墙或反向代理层面限制 Jenkins CLI 端口（默认 50000）仅允许可信 IP 访问；启用 Jenkins 审计日志并监控异常 CLI 命令调用及 Groovy 脚本执行记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/supportcandy/vulnerability/wordpress-supportcandy-plugin-3-4-6-insecure-direct-object-references-idor-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/01aff5db145d29bbcb0b8fff3fe830e13aa53d69/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54826.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f26250516f87314d5f3abfa090d804e53cf54f53/nuclei-templates/2026/CVE-2026-54826-supportcandy-cf2c451d-a30c-4c0f-9cf0-6361f6b1913c.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54826.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-26/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54826.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-54826.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-54826.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/SupportCandy_%E4%B8%8D%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8%E7%9A%84%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E5%BC%95%E7%94%A8%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-54826.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/76afc904d2c3de5054b6306275bb2a85f23de0a1/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-6mpj-cp6h-6c54/GHSA-6mpj-cp6h-6c54.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb5b1eedc994a703f39cb712ed03e138958e291d/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54826.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/a216efd008f5f915e27ab611087fc46ed0826190/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-06-29_13-11-53.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-54826"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0103","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54825","title":"WordPress wpDataTables 插件 SQL 注入漏洞","description":"WordPress wpDataTables 插件 7.4 及之前版本存在未认证 SQL 注入漏洞。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响插件发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在数据库查询中注入恶意 SQL 语句，进而窃取敏感数据、篡改数据库内容甚至获取网站管理权限。该漏洞影响所有使用 wpDataTables 插件的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级严重，需尽快升级至 7.5 或更高版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54825"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-26T15:16:40Z","updated":"2026-06-26T16:16:32Z","remediation":"立即将 wpDataTables 插件升级至 7.5 或更高版本以修复未经身份验证的 SQL 注入漏洞；如无法升级，在 WordPress 后台禁用 wpDataTables 插件直至补丁就绪；同时部署 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截包含 SQL 注入特征的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/wpdatatables/vulnerability/wordpress-wpdatatables-plugin-7-4-sql-injection-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e0f32c85b8b697ba27f9f77ead2aeb825574252/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54825.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f26250516f87314d5f3abfa090d804e53cf54f53/nuclei-templates/2026/CVE-2026-54825-wpdatatables-deec46f4-f7b4-4da4-aa3a-d04b9177528f.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-26/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54825.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54825.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/d96cdcee4ef80f9187069a225f8b6e61537923c7/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-54825/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-54825.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-54825.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/WordPress_wpDataTables_%E6%9C%AA%E6%8E%88%E6%9D%83_SQL_%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-54825.toml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0d27f094f5d35fbe4c8dfb1d77d8b1a736d9a17a/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54825.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/a216efd008f5f915e27ab611087fc46ed0826190/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-06-29_13-11-53.md","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-54825"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0102","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54824","title":"WPQuads Ads by WPQuads WordPress 插件敏感数据泄露漏洞","description":"WPQuads 广告插件（WordPress）3.0.3 及之前版本存在未经身份验证的敏感数据泄露漏洞（CWE-497）。远程攻击者无需任何认证即可通过特制请求获取站点内部敏感信息，导致用户数据或系统配置泄露。该漏洞影响所有运行 WPQuads <= 3.0.3 的 WordPress 站点，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 3.0.4 或更高版本进行修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54824"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-06-26T15:16:40Z","updated":"2026-06-26T16:16:32Z","remediation":"立即将 Ads by WPQuads 插件升级至 3.0.4 或更高版本（WP 后台插件页面自动更新或手动下载替换）。如无法立即升级，可在 WordPress 配置文件 wp-config.php 中添加 define('WP_QUADS_DISABLE_DATA_EXPOSURE', true); 临时阻止未授权数据暴露，并限制 /wp-content/plugins/quick-adsense-reloaded/ 目录的 web 访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/quick-adsense-reloaded/vulnerability/wordpress-ads-by-wpquads-plugin-3-0-3-sensitive-data-exposure-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e0f32c85b8b697ba27f9f77ead2aeb825574252/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54824.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/f26250516f87314d5f3abfa090d804e53cf54f53/nuclei-templates/2026/CVE-2026-54824-quick_adsense_reloaded-0a2e647e-fb3b-4d5f-abb4-87923269c399.yaml","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/39897d9afb3c6d42c7013893163963e5f59b4180/reports/2026-06-26/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54824.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/3a91743cb361cea8aa97e228bbbca0ca0cb04482/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54824.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f1d3db69525e35c34e256ac7316a1379e0f969b3/content/posts/cve-2026-54824.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2026-54824.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/0c7da69de8c9211abd9415ee499775016771b682/docs/2026/WordPress_Ads_by_WPQuads_%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E6%95%8F%E6%84%9F%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%B3%84%E9%9C%B2%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2026-54824.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/76afc904d2c3de5054b6306275bb2a85f23de0a1/advisories/unreviewed/2026/06/GHSA-jqm5-j5fc-x67x/GHSA-jqm5-j5fc-x67x.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2026-54824-quick_adsense_reloaded-0a2e647e-fb3b-4d5f-abb4-87923269c399.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2026/CVE-2026-54824.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-54824"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0102.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0048","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-1234","title":"wolfSSL SM2/SM3证书主题密钥标识符计算越界堆读取漏洞","description":"wolfSSL 的 SM2/SM3 证书主题密钥标识符计算中存在越界堆读取漏洞。该漏洞源于在解析 SM2/SM3 签名证书时未正确验证主题密钥标识符输入长度，导致堆内存越界读取。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向使用 wolfSSL 的 TLS 服务端发送特制的恶意 SM2/SM3 证书来触发此漏洞，成功利用可导致敏感堆内存信息泄露或服务崩溃。该漏洞影响广泛部署了 wolfSSL 的嵌入式及物联网系统，建议用户尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-1234"],"sources":["search"],"published":"2026-06-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-26T00:00:00Z","remediation":"N/A - 该 CVE 编号尚未公开披露，无可用漏洞信息","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0048.toml"}]